        <Notes>k__BackingField:
        - <Pos>k__BackingField: {x: 8740, y: 10100}
          <RawContent>k__BackingField: <p>This project demonstrates how you can create a short interactive movie using <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://docs.arcweave.com/project-items/assets/video">video assets</a>.</p><p>If you are completely new to Arcweave, you'd better start by recreating and studying the <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://docs.arcweave.com/workspaces/projects#project-templates">project template</a> called <strong>Interactive Fiction Example</strong>.</p>
          <ColorTheme>k__BackingField: lightBlue
        - <Pos>k__BackingField: {x: 9060, y: 10420}
          <RawContent>k__BackingField: <p>In this project, each element has a video asset as cover. Go to your <strong>Assets</strong> section (left sidebar, top) to preview all of them.</p>
          <ColorTheme>k__BackingField: cyan
        - <Pos>k__BackingField: {x: 9720, y: 10020}
          <RawContent>k__BackingField: <p>Double click the video attachment to configure its <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://docs.arcweave.com/project-items/assets/video#playback-behavior">playback behavior</a>.</p>
          <ColorTheme>k__BackingField: orange
        - <Pos>k__BackingField: {x: 10340, y: 10080}
          <RawContent>k__BackingField: <p>Use <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://docs.arcweave.com/project-items/variables/overview">variables</a> or the <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://docs.arcweave.com/project-items/arcscript#visits">visits() function</a> to create conditions for your <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://docs.arcweave.com/project-items/branches">branches</a>.</p>
          <ColorTheme>k__BackingField: cyan
        <Variables>k__BackingField: []
        <Attributes>k__BackingField: []
